	(text "ADC MUX (Stormcore ADC_SW): 000 MOS1, 001 MOS2, 010 MOT1, 011 MOT2, 100 EXT2 = VBAT_SENSE, 101 EXT1 = BUS_IMON, 110 EXT3, 111 V_BATT"
