		(at 280 165 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "ac41cd76-c547-549c-8684-b48364967c84")
	)
	(text "VBAT_SENSE = +BATT x 6.8k/106.8k (Power R2/R3): 42 V -> 2.67 V, 48 V -> 3.06 V. BUS_IMON = TPS48111 IMON, 30.6 mV/A: 60 A -> 1.84 V; >~105 A (only before the 80 A / 5 ms trip) exceeds 3.3 V, R814 1k limits the clamp current."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 280 170 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "e46830b4-6c2f-5bbe-a237-d440bc7b4ddf")
	)
	(text "VIN_SENS 39k/2.2k: 42 V -> 2.2 V. Feeds PC0 (VIN), PA3 (VM) and mux ch7 (V_BATT)."
